flowchart LR
    U[Human user] --> UI[Streamlit UI\napp.py]
    UI --> C[Context builder\n_build_pet_context()]
    C --> R[AI router + guardrails\napp.py + ai_reliability.py]
    R --> G[Gemini]
    R --> O[OpenAI]
    R --> A[Claude]
    G --> Q[Output quality check]
    O --> Q
    A --> Q
    Q -->|passes| OUT[AI answer shown in UI]
    Q -->|fails| F[Deterministic fallback\nScheduler summary]
    R -->|all fail| F
    F --> OUT
    OUT --> H[Human review\nreads answer and plan]

    T[Automated tests\npytest + ai_eval.py] --> R
    T --> Q
    T --> F
    T --> D[Developer checks\nlogs + README examples]
    D --> H
